{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/1cb95228cf9367d8fc2ba2daa3e2b427.poster.avif?t=1772143614\" width=600 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/1cb95228cf9367d8fc2ba2daa3e2b427.webm?t=1772143614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/1cb95228cf9367d8fc2ba2daa3e2b427.mp4?t=1772143614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/c7963604dfe925a5b6912765a4608f1d.poster.avif?t=1772143614\" width=720 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/c7963604dfe925a5b6912765a4608f1d.webm?t=1772143614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/c7963604dfe925a5b6912765a4608f1d.mp4?t=1772143614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Towerborne is an exciting side-scrolling Action RPG Brawler. Rise again as an Ace, an immortal warrior reborn to defend the Belfry against the darkness beyond its walls. Journey across a crumbling world, uncover the mystery of the fallen City of Numbers, and push back the corruption threatening humanity\u2019s survival.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Mayhem</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/c8239b0a311078ed75e2275d6fa206e1.poster.avif?t=1772143614\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/c8239b0a311078ed75e2275d6fa206e1.webm?t=1772143614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/c8239b0a311078ed75e2275d6fa206e1.mp4?t=1772143614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience classic combo-based brawler combat combined with a modern RPG. Customize your Ace with powerful gear, experiment with diverse combat styles, and refine your skills through relentless battles. Every fight makes you stronger, every victory opens new strategies, and every weapon reshapes your journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Your Way</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/9765435d1e18f1f3ed0eb466ab55f119.poster.avif?t=1772143614\" width=946 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/9765435d1e18f1f3ed0eb466ab55f119.webm?t=1772143614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/9765435d1e18f1f3ed0eb466ab55f119.mp4?t=1772143614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Whether you want quick pick-up-and-play sessions or intricate systems to master, Towerborne lets you choose your play style. Its fast-paced, responsive combat rewards timing and creativity, making every encounter feel fresh and challenging as you grow stronger.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Stronger Together</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/9ddc067436085e9d36466282260f2977.poster.avif?t=1772143614\" width=612 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/9ddc067436085e9d36466282260f2977.webm?t=1772143614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/9ddc067436085e9d36466282260f2977.mp4?t=1772143614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>Join forces with up to three other Aces or venture solo with Umbra lending unique abilities to your side. Teamwork amplifies the chaos and the thrill, where synergy and strategy make the difference between victory and defeat. Rally together to fight as one.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take an Unforgettable Journey</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/fe5d768ea2d29982915bd66c4100bebb.poster.avif?t=1772143614\" width=612 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/fe5d768ea2d29982915bd66c4100bebb.webm?t=1772143614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/fe5d768ea2d29982915bd66c4100bebb.mp4?t=1772143614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Towerborne expands beyond combat with a compelling Story Campaign designed to spark excitement and fuel unstoppable action. For players who crave more than battles, Towerborne\u2019s full story campaign brings to life the lore, characters, and stakes of the Belfry\u2019s survival.  Explore, progress, and uncover the world at your own pace and take your Ace\u2019s journey offline then reconnect online to fight alongside friends without missing a beat.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It's Pronounced \"GAH-bo\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2458830/f10d53c0091da90391a3d603a9ad1c10fb39bddb.jpg"},{"name":"New Mission, Who This?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2458830/50672f3f6740660b6b8813352baa8c73a137fc74.jpg"},{"name":"Not Just a Side Mission","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2458830/a89d6b9f15fc7b83d395433f936ef98b46d56208.jpg"},{"name":"We Respect Your Commitment to the Mission(s)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2458830/511467e79e4d00a336e4ac57f15366873fadbdd4.jpg"},{"name":"Mama Mia! That's a Lot of Missions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2458830/f32a5adfef566d2b7581c73e8f951eefa2390d5f.jpg"},{"name":"I Let the Umbra Do the Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2458830/07bbb3094c3cac649abb04b48293ace739490180.jpg"},{"name":"Gosh Darn it, Umbra Like Me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2458830/83c0b75440b88f8ae915c8b2d9ad1687ea3266c9.jpg"},{"name":"Win Friends and Influence Umbra","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2458830/f5438acea39529f2c642deb2c436656f662eed3a.jpg"},{"name":"The Real Lesson Was Friendship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2458830/e84f0f9329fa164a9265cdd75fe8c1930c0bddef.jpg"},{"name":"The Captain's Dilemma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2458830/0a287fd46bd1f9dccec64d123c41304805a82e28.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2458830?t=1772143614","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/0020cf1d398516f87c1b3e3b604a4323821b8b6e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772143614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/b0a440ef519c1ecfcefbf6201b3cd6900df73d8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772143614","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/b0a440ef519c1ecfcefbf6201b3cd6900df73d8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772143614","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Deluxe Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/408ede2b1a5c1c667fa5952f0651e9ea.avif?t=1772143614\" width=960 height=960 /></span><br><br>Step into the world of Towerborne with the Deluxe Edition, a premium bundle built to jumpstart your journey and keep you looking sharp as you face the wilds beyond the Belfry. Outfit your Ace with the Numbers Cosmetic Set and the Lazurite Cosmetic Set, then further customize your progression with 6 additional Rare Aspects and major drops of crafting resources\u2014a supply of Core crafting materials plus a trove of Advanced crafting materials. The Deluxe Edition helps you unlock customizations faster and style your adventure your way. Ideal for players who want early flexibility in builds and a distinctive look from day one.<br><br>Forge, fight, and flourish\u2014alone or alongside your crew\u2014on your path to become a legendary Ace of Towerborne.<br>What\u2019s included:<br>\u2022\t2 Numbers Cosmetic Sets<br>\u2022\tLazurite Cosmetic Set<br>\u2022\t6 additional Rare Aspects<br>\u2022\tSupply of Core crafting materials<br>\u2022\tTrove of advanced crafting materials</p><br><h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458830/extras/0a898c8cfea01d8455716e0e721293c4.avif?t=1772143614\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Don't miss out\